# Extended dynamic state (28 Nov, DXVK-style, SDK own 0032 enables the extensions): cull mode, front face, depth
# test / write / compare op and stencil test / ops are set per draw (vkCmdSet*EXT) instead of baked into each
# pipeline, and primitive restart too where VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state2 is offered. GetPipeline drops them from
# the key (StripDynamic), so draws that differ only in them share one pipeline: fewer pipelines to build, warm up
# and switch between. Only changed states are set (new DrawPacket::dyn_mask bits 10-18), all of them again after a
# rebind. BOTS_GFX_DYNAMIC_STATE=0 turns it off; the log says "extended dynamic state on/off/not offered".
# Switching it on or off rebuilds the pipelines once (the keys change).
